                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 837.00/1188</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Minister Gonzales to
                        the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegrams]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Habana</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-03-07T00:00:00-05:29">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">March 7, 1917, midnight</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Department’s March 6, 5 p.m. Blockade raised on all coal shipments. Cuban Consuls
                    notified to [issue] clearances.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Gonzales</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
